### GROMACS / MD (md/) -- generated per-run outputs ###
# 01_prep_protein.sh, 02_prep_molecule.sh, 03_run_md.sh each write into a
# freshly created output directory (e.g. gsta1_prepped/, gsh_prepped/) --
# fully regenerable from the scripts + md/system/raw_pdb inputs, so those
# directories are ignored wholesale rather than by extension.
md/system/*_prepped/
md/system/*_output/
mdout.mdp
#*#
*~

